<title>POLAND: POLIGRAFIA MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIGRAFIA MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.27 vs   0.20</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.54 vs   0.34</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.50 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Sales		    3.22 vs   2.93</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.75 vs   0.51</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.31 vs   0.87</p>
